Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
```turtle
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "NighttimeUrbanParkingLot" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :StateAnomaly ;
    :hasActor :vehicle1 ;
    :hasObstacle :roadMarkings ;
    :hasRisk :risk1, :risk2, :risk3 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 .

:vehicle1 a :Vehicle ;
    :description "Black sedan parked in front of another vehicle" .

:roadMarkings a :RoadObject ;
    :description "White lane markings and parking lot lines" .

:weather1 a :NightCondition .

:risk1 a :RearEndCollisionRisk ;
    :description "Potential rear-end collision risk due to vehicle parked too close to another vehicle" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:risk2 a :OcclusionRisk ;
    :description "Occlusion risk due to limited visibility in nighttime parking lot" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev2 .

:risk3 a :LaneIntrusionRisk ;
    :description "Lane intrusion risk due to vehicle occupying space in a narrow parking lane" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev3 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.75"^^xsd:float .

:sev2 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.60"^^xsd:float .

:sev3 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.55"^^xsd:float .
```

Identified Risks for each risk class:

**Risk 1:**
Description: Potential rear-end collision risk due to vehicle parked too close to another vehicle.
Severity Score: 0.75

**Risk 2:**
